Imagery: USDA NAIP aerial photography via USGS The National Map, which is
public domain, graded by Glamis Guide.

Places, descriptions and closed-area outlines: Copyright Glamis Guide
(Andy Eveland). Free for personal use with any app or device. Please do
not re-host the files, so riders get the current set. The closures follow
BLM and Wilderness Connect data and may lag official changes; obey posted
signs.
